/P 99 0 R
/E (Each member of the team will take on a specific role to ensure accountability and efficiency, while responsibilities will be shared collectively. Roles are not fixed, members may swap or take on multiple roles, but this will be a collective decision based on individual interests, agreed upon together with the team leader. In practice, everyone will contribute across roles depending on requirements, with work distributed equally Roles include Resource Investigator / Researcher, Documentation specialist, Planner/Co-Ordinator.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
